    "insert": "\nThis project proposal aims to explore how Large Language Models can serve as personalised AI tutors by optimising learning paths across multiple subjects using Sweller’s Cognitive Load Theory, and investigates the ethical requirements through a mixed-methods study comparing LLM-based and human tutoring\n\n"
